## Proposed Changes

### Component 1 — Article Content Registry

#### [MODIFY] [article_screen.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/presentation/screens/learn/article_screen.dart)

Add 4 missing articles to the `_articles` registry (each with full data matching [_ArticleData](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/presentation/screens/learn/article_screen.dart#10-33) structure):

