### Component 2 — Week Detail Screen (NEW)

#### [NEW] [week_screen.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/presentation/screens/learn/week_screen.dart)

A dedicated screen for each of the 12 study weeks that shows:
- **Hero banner** with week number, topic, and estimated time
- **Daily breakdown** — 7 daily tasks with checkboxes (saved locally via `SharedPreferences`)
- **Concept card** — illustrated explanation of the week's core idea
- **Key positions** — 3 FEN diagrams with static board preview widget (reuse [ChessBoardWidget](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/presentation/widgets/chess_board_widget.dart#9-52))
- **Practice button** — deep-links to a matching [TutorialLesson](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/data/models/tutorial_model.dart#3-21) ID from [tutorial_model.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/data/models/tutorial_model.dart)
- **Resource links** — 2–3 curated external links (Lichess, Chess.com, YouTube)

#### [MODIFY] [learn_screen.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/presentation/screens/learn/learn_screen.dart)

- Make each week row tappable → navigate to `/learn/week/:weekNumber`
- Add a **progress tracker** bar at the top of the 12-week section showing % of weeks completed
- Expand the [_WeekPlan](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/presentation/screens/learn/learn_screen.dart#40-47) model to include `description`, `tutorialId`, and `resourceLinks`

#### [MODIFY] [app_router.dart](file:///d:/PP942920DRIVE/PROJECTS/chess/app/lib/core/router/app_router.dart)

Add route: `path: 'week/:number'` inside the `/learn` shell route.

