## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
No existing unit tests for UI screens found in the project (`flutter test` has no relevant cases for `learn_screen` or `article_screen`). No new automated tests will be added; this is pure UI/content.

### Manual Verification

**Step 1 — Run the app**
```
cd d:\PP942920DRIVE\PROJECTS\chess\app
flutter run -d chrome
```

**Step 2 — Category articles all load**
- Go to **Learn** tab → tap each of the 5 categories
- Verify each opens an article with: title, content sections, key moves, study schedule, references

**Step 3 — 12-week plan rows are tappable**  
- Tap any week in the 12-week plan → verify a detail screen opens with daily tasks & practice button

**Step 4 — Progress tracker visible**  
- After tapping a daily task checkbox → return to learn screen → verify progress bar shows completed %

**Step 5 — Quick tactics quiz links to game**
- In the Quick Tactics Quiz section → tap "Try It" → verify the interactive tutorial board opens with the correct position
